<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Maintenance – Alerte Produit Santé</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #fff;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .tricolore {
    width: 100%;
    height: 5px;
    display: flex;
  }
  .tricolore span:nth-child(1) { flex: 1; background: #000091; }
  .tricolore span:nth-child(2) { flex: 1; background: #ffffff; }
  .tricolore span:nth-child(3) { flex: 1; background: #e1000f; }
  .container {
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 90%;
    margin: 30px auto 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 200px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    display: block;
  }
  .logo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .message {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .bold-msg {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 18px 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #777;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .container { margin: 20px auto 24px; }
    .logo { width: 150px; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
    .message { font-size: 1rem; }
  }
  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; }
    .tricolore { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="tricolore"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
<div class="container">
  <div class="logo">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Logo Gouvernement">
  </div>
  <p class="message">
    En raison d&rsquo;une op&eacute;ration de maintenance programm&eacute;e,<br>le site est temporairement indisponible.<br>
    Veuillez nous excuser pour la g&ecirc;ne occasionn&eacute;e.
  </p>
  <p class="bold-msg">Merci de renouveler votre demande ult&eacute;rieurement.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>